SCOPE OF THIS LICENCE

This licence covers the repository's source code, scripts, configuration files,
and original documentation. The included result tables and figures are provided
for reproducibility; please cite the associated paper when using them.

It does NOT cover the Secure Water Treatment (SWaT) dataset, which is not
distributed here. SWaT is provided by iTrust, Centre for Research in Cyber
Security, Singapore University of Technology and Design, under its own terms.
Obtain it directly from iTrust:

    https://itrust.sutd.edu.sg/itrust-labs_datasets/

See DATA.md for details.

It also does not grant rights to any manuscript or publisher-formatted paper
PDF. Only an approved final author-version PDF should be added to a public
release, subject to the applicable publisher policy.
